{
  "$schema": "folio-block-summaries/v1",
  "entry": "10665-44796",
  "summaries": [
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-000",
      "source": "sections/sec-000-wha-645-pandemic-influenza-preparedness-sharing.md",
      "source_hash": "ca9792eb00889e1bd0306be9194677dee413c12908b3dbe45f3f770aa0d81451",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Completes resolution WHA64.5, in which the Health Assembly welcomes and adopts the Pandemic Influenza Preparedness Framework and asks the Director-General to implement it and report every two years through the Executive Board.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-001",
      "source": "sections/sec-001-1-principles.md",
      "source_hash": "b1def26d4d32ef47243204da419c4d5aeb48f2033c5cb4f0802a936815f6e94e",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out the Framework's principles, in which Member States recall resolution WHA60.28 and note the continuing risk of a devastating influenza pandemic, especially for developing countries. They affirm the value of rapid virus sharing alongside fair access to vaccines and benefits, and recognize the need for technology transfer and financing that makes vaccines and medicines affordable for developing countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-002",
      "source": "sections/sec-002-2-objective.md",
      "source_hash": "50a93b578403ad8cdf9ee7ee0404f4f66331a3ae4dffcda464be2944c093e8dc",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States the Framework's objective: to improve pandemic preparedness and response by strengthening WHO's global influenza surveillance and response system, with a fair and transparent system for sharing H5N1 and other potentially pandemic viruses and for access to vaccines and other benefits.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-003",
      "source": "sections/sec-003-3-scope.md",
      "source_hash": "c8eaacf13568857ff20fc4ea3e415bb5bf264642a1cc989ebafaa1f53073e7dd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines the Framework's scope as the sharing of H5N1 and other influenza viruses with human pandemic potential and related benefits, excluding seasonal influenza and other pathogens.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-004",
      "source": "sections/sec-004-4-definitions-and-use-of-terms.md",
      "source_hash": "fa1fe3cec15e07676306fa80e6d135ea362767105629b93d0f3ebcc013b2d10c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Introduces the section defining terms used in the Framework.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-005",
      "source": "sections/sec-005-41-pandemic-influenza-preparedness-biological-ma.md",
      "source_hash": "4a2091c8b654593a6ce73aaaf06c89daffb005386125c4b70def701983eb4270",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines 'PIP biological materials' as clinical specimens, wild-type and modified isolates of H5N1 and other potentially pandemic influenza viruses, and their extracted RNA and cDNA covering whole gene coding regions.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-006",
      "source": "sections/sec-006-42-other-technical-terms.md",
      "source_hash": "98f456413b90786819fc59848252ec118578efb722b8744fc41cff585c197d0f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines further technical terms used in the Framework, such as genetic sequences, reference reagents, candidate vaccine viruses and wild-type influenza viruses.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-007",
      "source": "sections/sec-007-43-institutions-organizations-and-entities.md",
      "source_hash": "895c409d462752c8c7c0b64608cc3e27fa1e76d02d604cb5a180103451bc656f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines the institutions involved, such as essential regulatory laboratories, influenza vaccine, diagnostic and drug manufacturers and the laboratories that make up WHO's global influenza surveillance and response system.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-008",
      "source": "sections/sec-008-44-other-terms.md",
      "source_hash": "b8c5b5fadb2ae643dd4ce37ca23a86258a7f6c232b6f2b598a5051f05d764ef9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines other terms used in the Framework, including Advisory Group, affected country, least-developed country and the PIP vaccine stockpile.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-009",
      "source": "sections/sec-009-5-pandemic-influenza-preparedness-system-for-sha.md",
      "source_hash": "0aef5a0c2e0d7a7f3808199cb4495e43d8274448751de46cd8993f8f61c10de1",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A heading for the section on the system for sharing H5N1 and other potentially pandemic influenza viruses.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-010",
      "source": "sections/sec-010-51-general.md",
      "source_hash": "dab7a2a87d9019c5903888542b5922d48b97838319f50dce93b5595236b153e2",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out that Member States should rapidly share PIP biological materials from all cases of H5N1 and other potentially pandemic influenza through their national laboratories with a WHO Collaborating Centre or H5 Reference Laboratory of their choice. It notes they may also share bilaterally if WHO laboratories receive the materials with priority.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-011",
      "source": "sections/sec-011-52-genetic-sequence-data.md",
      "source_hash": "9f582ff306afbfd6e5298f878329dfcc685de86d856df4f687c7277d823ceb68",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Calls for rapid sharing of genetic sequence data on potentially pandemic influenza viruses with originating laboratories and within GISRS, and asks the Director-General to seek advice on handling such data.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-012",
      "source": "sections/sec-012-53-traceability-and-reporting-mechanisms.md",
      "source_hash": "5ead47641c8fa89b4637a08c4f22f6284dfe0701519ed446415ab3ac64224e2a",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits the Director-General to set up an electronic system to track in real time the movement of PIP biological materials into, within and out of GISRS, and to give feedback to originating laboratories and countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-013",
      "source": "sections/sec-013-54-standard-material-transfer-agreements.md",
      "source_hash": "c7b904f0627dbbe6f99c388687dee5b7ac4054154c2a941bec1c5a6b85cd8dbd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States that Standard Material Transfer Agreement 1 governs transfers of PIP biological materials within GISRS, and that SMTA 2 will be used for agreements with entities outside it.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-014",
      "source": "sections/sec-014-60-general.md",
      "source_hash": "a853fef07e841625055d3342d3eb2d718fc5f7c4ecc931ae10984c59ec52ef79",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out the general aims of the PIP benefit-sharing system, to which Member States and manufacturers should contribute, covering surveillance and risk assessment, access to vaccines and supplies, and capacity building and technology transfer for receiving countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-015",
      "source": "sections/sec-015-6-pandemic-influenza-preparedness-benefit-sharin.md",
      "source_hash": "fd0095213cb9f361b8e0ee4dfba7461ea7cce94a4c1c2fe657df7e1a403d31de",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Notes that the benefit-sharing system includes the elements set out in the rest of the section.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-016",
      "source": "sections/sec-016-61-who-coordination-of-pandemic-influenza-prepar.md",
      "source_hash": "7026dff144937000efdaab3c96971ca9e7348b24e25a526074e6906ad4bb528f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "States that WHO will coordinate pandemic preparedness and response under the International Health Regulations (2005), with attention to fair and transparent allocation of scarce vaccines, antivirals and diagnostics according to public health risk and need.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-017",
      "source": "sections/sec-017-62-pandemic-risk-assessment-and-risk-response.md",
      "source_hash": "c2c7c78c2278bbd1d68fa87225e7f0a055ea408a5134ab6657a9761ad7a4442c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits GISRS laboratories to share laboratory analysis reports with WHO and originating countries, and WHO to support countries, especially developing ones, in pandemic risk assessment and response through information and technical assistance.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-018",
      "source": "sections/sec-018-63-provision-of-pip-candidate-vaccine-viruses.md",
      "source_hash": "9299f9863b1f14a1d5e69463a8e76151d80d860fcd59c42ecb02620c79aaa38f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out that WHO laboratories will provide candidate vaccine viruses on request to manufacturers without preference and at the same time to Member States' laboratories, under appropriate biosafety rules.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-019",
      "source": "sections/sec-019-64-provision-of-diagnostic-reagents-and-test-kit.md",
      "source_hash": "db57f7349b689f482bb7c213b4b5678feb6766bcde57bcc546b522dc1b431a67",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits WHO laboratories to supply free non-commercial diagnostic reagents and test kits to national laboratories and urges diagnostic manufacturers to provide them free or at reduced cost.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-020",
      "source": "sections/sec-020-65-provision-of-reference-reagents-for-potency-d.md",
      "source_hash": "aa403c6410050d429c5dd8bf56f983e0758394fdb5ac3cbebebe4feb9ef70951",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits essential regulatory laboratories to provide reference reagents for vaccine potency testing and training in vaccine quality control to all Member States on request.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-021",
      "source": "sections/sec-021-66-laboratory-and-influenza-surveillance-capacit.md",
      "source_hash": "b2eeea5258cc691f3674d44a13b93fbea5126f3a30bc5b736fdba888bfa6dc69",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Urges Member States with advanced capacity to help others, especially developing countries, build laboratory and influenza surveillance capacity, including virus detection and research.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-022",
      "source": "sections/sec-022-67-regulatory-capacity-building.md",
      "source_hash": "14bb76c86d93ccffdc3c8dc8c8e90cab24bd3d02d38040556aab5d3244e63c69",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Calls on Member States with advanced regulatory capacity to help strengthen regulators in developing countries so that pandemic influenza vaccines, diagnostics and medicines can be approved rapidly, and to share information on approvals.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-023",
      "source": "sections/sec-023-68-antivirals-stockpiles.md",
      "source_hash": "44144c2f91efb46215c2c566776401795c4f4625215877827b3750c44b6475fb",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits the Director-General to work with partners and manufacturers to maintain a WHO stockpile of antiviral medicines and to seek expert advice on its size and use.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-024",
      "source": "sections/sec-024-69-pandemic-influenza-preparedness-vaccine-stock.md",
      "source_hash": "0d63893f7ae4cf74b2f3e385df44ea3db21a238837edc533374d2d28e13f8174",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits the Director-General to establish a WHO stockpile of vaccines for H5N1 and other potentially pandemic viruses, initially 150 million doses, with related equipment. It covers allocation according to expert guidance and plans for deploying the vaccines to affected countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-025",
      "source": "sections/sec-025-610-access-to-vaccines-in-the-inter-pandemic-per.md",
      "source_hash": "fcde1fbd4a726e8854d3de6b4e9658169fe04d2f6cb5a546c055217944d25206",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Urges manufacturers to reserve part of each production cycle of H5N1 and other potentially pandemic vaccines for developing countries and seeks timely access for them at tiered prices.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-026",
      "source": "sections/sec-026-611-access-to-pandemic-influenza-vaccines.md",
      "source_hash": "369dbdaa73582d165cf67e5553b5b6af8e24cf887004a170b4f1177e8bf97318",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Urges manufacturers to reserve part of pandemic vaccine production for developing countries and calls for an expert group to develop mechanisms for distributing vaccines by public health risk and need.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-027",
      "source": "sections/sec-027-612-tiered-pricing.md",
      "source_hash": "c258dfe4c14606d924ffc91a032a086631353dac7234f0d2883929331b6cb3bd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Urges vaccine and antiviral manufacturers to apply tiered pricing that takes account of country income levels, with attention to the least developed countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-028",
      "source": "sections/sec-028-613-technology-transfer.md",
      "source_hash": "d02b5feb7d96675cefabd311fd4da5085948d5f653ae97db6a7dbe46d9b9fa48",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Commits WHO to continue the Global Pandemic Influenza Action Plan to Increase Vaccine Supply, including new production facilities and transfer of technology and know-how. It urges manufacturers to support technology transfer and suggests countries consider seasonal influenza vaccination to sustain local production.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-029",
      "source": "sections/sec-029-614-sustainable-and-innovative-financing-mechani.md",
      "source_hash": "a1b0c507f9771350dc7f5e851fce64d30427b0e35f0b60c68f19505d391dc143",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out financing for the benefit-sharing system, including an annual Partnership Contribution from manufacturers that use GISRS, its use for preparedness and response and how it is managed. It also urges Member States to increase support for laboratory and surveillance capacity in developing countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-030",
      "source": "sections/sec-030-7-governance-and-review.md",
      "source_hash": "b62b69628edf78e858fdb6e1fa366246f2d8667b943aee37c30ca0815ec75b1e",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A heading for the section on governance and review of the Framework.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-031",
      "source": "sections/sec-031-71-general.md",
      "source_hash": "676499ba1943e3b003656f53912fcf9d85890229e5d41b99c6582e6b165f3470",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out that the World Health Assembly oversees the Framework with advice from the Director-General, through an oversight mechanism that includes an independent Advisory Group of international experts.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-032",
      "source": "sections/sec-032-72-advisory-group.md",
      "source_hash": "1a7fc133fd3d51824cda6a2ce015dfd47b591d94516eced662f367ac1c0c0dfc",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes the Advisory Group's role in monitoring and advising on the Framework without administrative or public functions, its membership and reporting, and asks for a report to the Health Assembly in 2012 on its future mandate.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-033",
      "source": "sections/sec-033-73-governance-and-review-of-terms-of-reference-f.md",
      "source_hash": "2c8d19859e5873b94abd6167d03ed801e68fd343759c25af033eedef568ec3bf",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Covers terms of reference for GISRS laboratories, a review of the definition of PIP biological materials and a full review of the Framework by 2016, with proposals to the Health Assembly in 2017.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-034",
      "source": "sections/sec-034-annexes.md",
      "source_hash": "a78c371596e60202717419f7f3ee992f931c98eb68603297e1decdfb08cf609f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Contains the Framework's annexes, beginning with Standard Material Transfer Agreement 1, which sets the terms for transferring PIP biological materials within GISRS. It then gives Standard Material Transfer Agreement 2 for transfers to recipients outside GISRS, including manufacturers' commitments to benefit sharing. The articles cover the parties, obligations, intellectual property, liability and dispute settlement, with signature blocks.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-035",
      "source": "sections/sec-035-annex-3-advisory-group-terms-of-reference.md",
      "source_hash": "67e17acefa01973295bb1d5cb9dcb32d5ed6ed46baa17de8aeb1913cc53b9ea8",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Gives the Advisory Group's terms of reference, adopted in 2008 and amended in 2011, covering its mandate, membership, functions and working methods. It also explains WHO's duty to provide resources for the Group and introduces Annex 4 on guiding principles for laboratory terms of reference.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-036",
      "source": "sections/sec-036-system-gisrs-laboratories-for-h5n1-and-other-hum.md",
      "source_hash": "7d963483b43fa69afbd51f5b48f39548210bdce6f7a5c8d21aa3da2c466bfe01",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out guiding principles for the terms of reference of GISRS laboratories working with H5N1 and other potentially pandemic viruses, noting that roles differ between centre types. It covers sharing of materials under SMTA 1 and giving due credit to contributing laboratories.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-037",
      "source": "sections/sec-037-annex-5-terms-of-reference-related-to-work-with.md",
      "source_hash": "ad2685ca93b321c5f99e1dca606e1508e01aef2fae7714f2469f84ad01abc597",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Annex 5 sets out the terms of reference for work with PIP biological materials by the four types of GISRS institutions: National Influenza Centres, WHO Collaborating Centres, H5 Reference Laboratories and essential regulatory laboratories. For each it describes functions such as collecting and sharing specimens and viruses, characterizing them, developing candidate vaccine viruses and reference reagents, and supporting risk assessment. It also covers biosafety, publication and recognition of originating laboratories. The annex ends with the ISBN and WHO contact details.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44796/blocks/prose-sec-front-matter",
      "source": "sections/sec-front-matter.md",
      "source_hash": "40b4d5253ab8f261c7b85905c4821312b338a763a563811975265e5f712da923",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The front matter of WHO's 2011 Pandemic Influenza Preparedness Framework for the sharing of influenza viruses and access to vaccines and other benefits. It contains the title and copyright pages and contents, and begins World Health Assembly resolution WHA64.5 of 24 May 2011, which considered the report of the Open-Ended Working Group of Member States.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
